  "title": "The Common Fund Data Ecosystem Debuts at the American Society of Human Genetics",
  "bodyHtml": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Common Fund Data Ecosystem (CFDE) took the human genetics community by storm at the American Society of Human Genetics 2024 Annual Meeting in Denver, Colorado. CFDE hosted a lively exhibition booth, where meeting attendees learned about CFDE and its applications to their research. Additionally, the CFDE team organized an ASHG Ancillary Session entitled, “A Human Geneticists’ Guide to the Common Fund Data Ecosystem,” which featured updates from the&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://hugeamp.org/r/kc_landing\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>CFDE Knowledge Center</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, the&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://data.cfde.cloud/\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>CFDE Data Resource Center</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">the Molecular Transducers of Physical Activity Consortium&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://motrpac-data.org/\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>(MoTrPAC)</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, and the NIH. A few new highlights were featured, including revamped&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://hugeamp.org/r/kc_programs\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>CFDE program information</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> and novel tools to explore&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://hugeamp.org/r/kc_dge_top_20?q=1&amp;source=kc_diffexp\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>differential gene expression</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> and&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://hugeamp.org/r/kc_gene_set_browser_source?source=all\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>connect gene sets to phenotypes</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> within CFDE.&nbsp;</span></p>",
  "summary": "CFDE debuts at ASHG",
